  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the International Organisation for Migration for provision of Water, Sanitation and resilience building programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to prevent, reduce and mitigate serious health and associated threats for vulnerable people through multi-sectoral life-saving support in IDP sites and hard-to-reach areas in Unity and Upper Nile states.</narrative>
